<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ms">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>PlatoMy - Malaysian Community Hub</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@600;800;900&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #050508;
      --bg-card: #0c0812;
      --pink-accent: #F996B1;
      --pink-dark: #a84763;
      --pink-glow: rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.45);
      --pink-glow-sharp: rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.8);
      --text-main: #f0e6f5;
      --text-muted: #9e8aa8;
      --grad-primary: linear-gradient(135deg, #F996B1 0%, #c4587c 50%, #15081a 100%);
      --grad-chrome: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #F996B1 40%, #2b0b18 100%);
      --grad-card: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(25, 15, 30, 0.9) 0%, rgba(8, 5, 12, 0.95) 100%);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.12) 0%, transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 70%, rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.08) 0%, transparent 45%),
        linear-gradient(rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 100% 100%, 100% 100%, 32px 32px, 32px 32px;
    }

    /* Scanline overlay for Y2K feel */
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 50%);
      background-size: 100% 4px;
      z-index: 999;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    /* Top Ticker */
    .ticker-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      background: rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.12);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pink-glow);
      overflow: hidden;
      white-space: nowrap;
      padding: 6px 0;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--pink-accent);
    }
    .ticker-content {
      display: inline-block;
      animation: marquee 25s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes marquee {
      0% { transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0); }
      100% { transform: translate3d(-50%, 0, 0); }
    }

    /* Navigation */
    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 14px 5%;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.2);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      background: rgba(5, 5, 8, 0.85);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: #fff;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .brand-logo {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 2px solid var(--pink-accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--pink-glow-sharp);
    }

    .brand span {
      color: var(--pink-accent);
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--pink-glow-sharp);
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    nav a:hover, nav a.active {
      color: var(--pink-accent);
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--pink-glow);
    }

    .btn-cyber {
      background: var(--pink-accent);
      color: #050508;
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--pink-glow);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      clip-path: polygon(8px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 8px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 8px);
    }

    .btn-cyber:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--pink-accent);
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #a84763;
    }

    /* Container */
    .main-container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 30px 16px;
    }

    /* User Profile Card */
    .profile-banner {
      background: var(--grad-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.3);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.1);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .profile-info h2 {
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .profile-info p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      max-width: 600px;
      white-space: pre-line;
    }

    .status-badge {
      background: rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.2);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    /* Stats Grid */
    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .section-title span {
      color: var(--pink-accent);
    }

    .grid-3 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 650px) {
      .grid-3 {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      }
    }

    .cyber-card {
      background: var(--grad-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.25);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 20px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .cyber-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--grad-chrome);
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .cyber-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: var(--pink-accent);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.2);
    }

    .card-tag {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      color: var(--pink-accent);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: block;
    }

    .card-value {
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #fff;
    }

    /* Event Akan Datang Box */
    .events-box {
      background: var(--grad-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.3);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .event-item {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.15);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .event-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .event-title {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .event-date {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--pink-accent);
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(249, 150, 177, 0.2);
      padding: 20px 16px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      background: rgba(5, 5, 8, 0.95);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    footer span {
      color: var(--pink-accent);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Ticker pengumuman -->
  <div class="ticker-wrap">
    <div class="ticker-content">
      ✦ PLATOMY BANK DASHBOARD ✦ SECURE DISCORD LINKED ✦ REAL-TIME WALLET & LEADERBOARD SYNC ✦ WELCOME TO THE Y2K REALM ✦
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Header / Navigation -->
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1549051773438787724/1549403998686281808/IMG_5614.png" alt="Logo PlatoMy" class="brand-logo">
      Plato<span>My Bank</span>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#" class="active">Dashboard</a>
      <a href="#wallet">Wallet</a>
      <a href="#leaderboard">Leaderboard</a>
    </nav>
    <a href="/logout" class="btn-cyber" style="text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;">Log Keluar</a>
  </header>

  <!-- Kandungan Utama Dashboard -->
  <div class="main-container">

    <!-- Profile Sambutan & Ayat PlatoMy Bank -->
    <div class="profile-banner">
      <div class="profile-info">
        <h2>Hi, <%= user.username %>! 🌸</h2>
        <p>Selamat Datang ke PlatoMy Bank! 🌸

Setiap ganjaran, usaha dan sumbangan anda kini berada di satu tempat. Semak baki Plato Coins, Pips dan jumlah tajaan terkumpul anda dengan mudah.

PlatoMy Bank
💗 Your rewards, all in one place.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="status-badge">
        <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); display: block; margin-bottom: 2px;">Status Sambungan</span>
        <span style="color: #50fa7b; font-weight: bold; font-family: 'Orbitron'; font-size: 0.8rem;">● Neon DB Active</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Baharu: Event Akan Datang -->
    <h2 class="section-title"><span>✦</span> Event Akan Datang</h2>
    <div class="events-box">
      <div class="event-item">
        <div class="event-title">🎉 PlatoMy Community Giveaway & Rumble</div>
        <div class="event-date">Akan Datang (Rujuk Discord)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="event-item">
        <div class="event-title">🎙️ Special Voice Room & Trading Night</div>
        <div class="event-date">Setiap Hujung Minggu</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Statistik Wallet Pengguna -->
    <h2 class="section-title"><span>✦</span> Aset Wallet Anda</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      
      <div class="cyber-card">
        <span class="card-tag">🪙 Plato Coins</span>
        <div class="card-value"><%= wallet.coins.toLocaleString() %></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cyber-card">
        <span class="card-tag">💠 Pips</span>
        <div class="card-value"><%= wallet.pips.toLocaleString() %></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cyber-card">
        <span class="card-tag">🌸 Total Sponsor</span>
        <div class="card-value"><%= wallet.sponsorTotal.toLocaleString() %></div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 <span>PlatoMy Community</span>. Powered by Y2K Cyber Aesthetics & Neon PostgreSQL.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
